Currently, I cannot find a proper way to limit the length of an array.

I wish there are functions which can return the first or last n elements of an array.

## Example
```
first([0, 1, 2, 3], 3)
// Output: [0, 1, 2]

first([0], 3)
// Output: [0]

last([0, 1, 2, 3], 3)
// Output: [1, 2, 3]

last(["apple", "book", "car", "door"], 2)
